<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.8">
<l>urampaṟṟi yiraṇiyaṉai yukirnutiyā</l>
<l rend="indent">loḷḷiyamār puṟaikka vūṉṟi</l>
<l>cirampaṟṟi muṭiyiṭiyak kaṇpituṅka</l>
<l rend="indent">vāyalarat teḻittāṉ kōyil</l>
<l>urampeṟṟa malarkkamala mulakaḷanta</l>
<l rend="indent">cēvaṭipō luyarntu kāṭṭa</l>
<l>varampuṟṟa katirccennel tāḷcāyttut</l>
<l rend="indent">talaivaṇakkun taṇṇa raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple of him who, with mouth wide, roared</l>
<l rend="indent">when, having grasped [his] chest,</l>
<l rend="indent">[he] crushed the bright chest of Hiraṇya</l>
<l rend="indent">with the tips of [his] claws,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] clutching [his] head,</l>
<l rend="indent">[he] squeezed so that [his] crown broke</l>
<l rend="indent">and [his] eyes bulged out,</l>
<l>is cool Araṅkam where,</l>
<l rend="indent">while fertilized lotus blossoms appear</l>
<l rend="indent">rising like the red feet that measured the worlds,</l>
<l rend="indent">the red paddy with grain that was planted in ridges</l>
<l rend="indent">bend their stalks [as if] bending [their] heads.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
